# Local Odaflow auth (fixed ports)

OdaWeb is the **unified login hub**. When building or testing CRM, People, ERP, or any SSO/handoff flow locally, also run OdaWeb with `npm run dev`. You can start apps in any order.

## Ports (do not change, do not hop)

| App | Command | URL |
|---|---|---|
| OdaWeb (hub) | `npm run dev` in `OdaWeb` | http://localhost:5173 |
| CRM | `npm run dev` in `odacrm` | http://localhost:5174 |
| People | `npm run dev` in `oda_hr` | http://localhost:5175 |
| ERP | `npm run dev` in `ERPbyodaflow` | http://localhost:3000 |

Vite/Next must **fail** if that port is taken (`strictPort` / `--port 3000`). Never let the app move to 5176 or 3001 — handoff and cookies break.

## What to run

- Sign-in, logout, launchpad, or switching apps → OdaWeb on **5173** must be up.
- Launchpad: http://localhost:5173/apps
- Only the one product under test can stay down. Do not invent new local ports or point local SSO at production webs.
